<title>USA: Hibernia Corp Q3 shr $0.22.</title>
<headline>Hibernia Corp Q3 shr $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.22		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net		 26,600		   34,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  120,597		  120,082</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.65		    $0.75</p>
<p> Net		 77,937		   90,879</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: For the third quarter of 1995, reported net income of $34.2 million ($.28 per common share) would have been $23.4 million ($.20 per common share) on a fully tax-effected basis. Therefore, on a comparable basis, net income for the third quarter of 1996 increased 14 percent from the third quarter last year, and earnings per common share grew 10 percent.</p>
<p>For the year-ago nine-month period, net income on a fully tax-effected basis was $62.2 million, which would have represented earnings per common share of $.51.</p>
